1
00:00:00,320 --> 00:00:01,560
Ask Grandpa Lou.

2
00:00:01,560 --> 00:00:02,359
Somebody wrote,

3
00:00:02,359 --> 00:00:03,759
"Should I text first,

4
00:00:03,759 --> 00:00:05,120
or will I look desperate?"

5
00:00:05,120 --> 00:00:06,379
Sweetheart,

6
00:00:06,379 --> 00:00:07,740
desperate is waiting three

7
00:00:07,740 --> 00:00:08,900
days to answer a message

8
00:00:08,900 --> 00:00:10,679
you read in three seconds.

9
00:00:10,679 --> 00:00:13,519
Text first, call first, whatever.

10
00:00:13,519 --> 00:00:14,560
Whoever goes first

11
00:00:14,560 --> 00:00:15,599
isn't the loser,

12
00:00:15,599 --> 00:00:16,059
they're the one

13
00:00:16,059 --> 00:00:17,359
with the guts.

14
00:00:17,359 --> 00:00:18,800
Angie went first once.

15
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:19,800
She called the garage

16
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:20,859
and left a message

17
00:00:20,859 --> 00:00:21,579
with my boss.

18
00:00:22,460 --> 00:00:24,699
Biggest embarrassment of my life.

19
00:00:24,699 --> 00:00:25,320
I married her.

20
00:00:26,239 --> 00:00:27,420
Send your questions.

21
00:00:27,420 --> 00:00:28,480
I'll answer the good ones.

